{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 John the Ripper 套件 unshadow，用于合并 /etc/shadow 与 /etc/passwd。对应需求：凭据窃取。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux疑似unshadow凭据转储","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n主机执行 unshadow 且参数数量符合转储用法。\n\n### 为何重要\n可导出哈希供离线破解。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 确认执行用户与命令行目标文件。\n2. 查找 john/hashcat 等后续进程。\n3. 检查 shadow 读取与外传。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","references":["https://www.cyberciti.biz/faq/unix-linux-password-cracking-john-the-ripper/"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"e7cb3cfd-aaa3-4d7b-af18-23b89955062c","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用对应数据源（Elastic Defend / System / Windows / auditd，按规则说明）。\n2. 机器学习规则需关联 ML job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","对应需求: 凭据审计"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\") and\nprocess.name == \"unshadow\" and process.args_count >= 3\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1003","name":"OS Credential Dumping","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1003.008","name":"/etc/passwd and /etc/shadow","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/008/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1005","name":"Data from Local System","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1005/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}}],"false_positives":["授权的密码审计或红队演练"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","source.ip","event.action","event.outcome","event.code","process.name","message","event.original","agent.id"]},"version":115,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
